@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛她们来到淋浴房，<br>正好遇到调查中的蕾雅、玛格、米莉亚三人。|#0101Adv33_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:对面似乎是<br>在搜查期间正好遇上，才一起行动的。|#0101Adv33_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Angry1
@Wait WaitMode:1
@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜一脸不悦地皱起眉头，<br>马上就离开了淋浴房。|#0101Adv33_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Smile1,ArmL4

[PrintTextModified Text:哎呀，你们也在玩侦探游戏吗？|#0101Adv33_Margo001| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:刚还在调查柜子的玛格，<br>转过脸对着艾玛她们轻轻一笑。|#0101Adv33_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:才不是什么游戏……！|#0101Adv33_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1,ArmR18,ArmL13

[PrintTextModified Text:算啦，现在不是吵架的时候。|#0101Adv33_Sherry001| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:在雪莉的劝说下，<br>艾玛做了深呼吸，总算压抑住不快的感情。|#0101Adv33_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（玛格是故意这么讲话惹我们不爽的。<br>　我要冷静才行）|#0101Adv33_Ema002|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR1,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:你们那边有收获什么线索吗？|#0101Adv33_Sherry002| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅耸了耸肩，以示回应。|#0101Adv33_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Normal1,ArmR3
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:不，完全没有有力的线索。|#0101Adv33_Leia001| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我们的看法基本达成一致，<br>最可疑的人就是汉娜。|#0101Adv33_Margo002| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜绝对不会做出这样的事！|#0101Adv33_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛这下真的生气了。<br>这时，蕾雅深深地叹了口气。|#0101Adv33_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Pensive1,Arms

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛，你对汉娜她<br>到底有多少了解？|#0101Adv33_Leia002| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我几乎不了解她。|#0101Adv33_Leia003| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她或许是会动手杀人的少女，<br>也或许不是。|#0101Adv33_Leia004| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我有点羡慕你，<br>可以发自真心地信任他人。|#0101Adv33_Leia005| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Angry1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:……蕾雅，<br>你难道无法相信任何人吗……？|#0101Adv33_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛反问的声音软弱无力，根本算不上反击。<br>这时，蕾雅露出了温柔的微笑。|#0101Adv33_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1,ArmR3,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:我想保护所有人。<br>所以，我会尽全力保护我所相信的少女们，不受魔女的伤害。|#0101Adv33_Leia006| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:"（我不认为蕾雅的想法是错误的。<br>　可是，汉娜她……）|#0101Adv33_Ema005|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（她愿意和没有朋友的我一起玩。<br>　……虽然这可能只是我单方面的情感）|#0101Adv33_Ema006|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText


[PrintTextModified Text:"（我想要相信，相信汉娜她<br>　并不是魔女）|#0101Adv33_Ema007|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:看来淋浴房也没什么线索。<br>怎么办？要离开吗？|#0101Adv33_Sherry003| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉轻轻碰了碰艾玛的肩膀。|#0101Adv33_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛她——|#0101Adv33_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

