# Choice1-1-8

@RecordCorrectChoice Number:8

[PrintTextModified Text:向雪莉点了点头。|#0101Adv33_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯……<br>哦，还有件事，我想问一下她们魔法的事。|#0101Adv33_Ema008| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我们不知道蕾雅你们<br>会用怎样的魔法。|#0101Adv33_Ema009| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Surprised1,ArmR10,ArmL4

[PrintTextModified Text:呃……|#0101Adv33_Miria001| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:发出了惊讶声的<br>是米莉亚。|#0101Adv33_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@Wait WaitMode:0.3
@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:Miria Loop:false ScenePositionY:20 Scale:2 Duration:1

[PrintTextModified Text:她猛地凑到艾玛面前。|#0101Adv33_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这是一位一头金发，穿着耳钉，<br>由头到脚都打理得美丽动人的，拥有模特身材的超魅力少女。|#0101Adv33_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这样一位美少女在超近距离面对着自己，<br>艾玛忍不住吞了吞口水。|#0101Adv33_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:魔、魔魔魔魔魔法怎么可能会存在呢？<br>别再说这个话题了好吗？哈哈哈哈哈。|#0101Adv33_Miria002| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:一阵干笑声<br>响遍整间淋浴房。|#0101Adv33_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:（超、超级可疑……！）|#0101Adv33_Ema010| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这时，蕾雅清了清嗓子。|#0101Adv33_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Normal1,ArmR3,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:既然艾玛你怎样也使不出魔法，<br>那不就说明，不是每个人都对自己的魔法有认知，对不对？|#0101Adv33_Leia007| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，嗯。说得有道理……|#0101Adv33_Ema011| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1,ArmR3,ArmL2

[PrintTextModified Text:顺带一提，我似乎是在无意中<br>使出了轻微地诱惑了你们的魔法。|#0101Adv33_Leia008| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（确实有这个感觉）|#0101Adv33_Ema012| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1,ArmR1,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:还有其他问题吗？|#0101Adv33_Leia009| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:呃……还有，我想知道你们昨晚的行动。|#0101Adv33_Ema013| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:Miria Loop:false ScenePositionY:50 Wait:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:1 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Surprised1,ArmR10,ArmL4

[PrintTextModified Text:呃……|#0101Adv33_Miria003| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@Wait WaitMode:0.3
@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:Miria Loop:false ScenePositionY:20 Scale:2 Duration:1

[PrintTextModified Text:米莉亚又一次发出惊讶声，<br>又慌张地靠近了艾玛。|#0101Adv33_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然我和小蕾睡一间房，但只是单纯的室友关系哦？<br>并没有什么奇怪的意思哦？|#0101Adv33_Miria004| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我和她睡的床也不是同一张哦？|#0101Adv33_Miria005| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:…………|#0101Adv33_Leia010| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:…………|#0101Adv33_Ema014| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:你说得这么慌张，<br>反而更招人怀疑了耶。|#0101Adv33_Sherry004| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉满面笑容，自然地发出吐槽。|#0101Adv33_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:Miria Loop:false ScenePositionY:50 Wait:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:1 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Fearful1,ArmR8,ArmL7

[PrintTextModified Text:啊啊啊……|#0101Adv33_Miria006| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:米莉亚双手抱头。|#0101Adv33_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:"（我其实更想问<br>　昨天晚上直播的事）|#0101Adv33_Ema015|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（这股尴尬死的气氛究竟是怎么回事……）|#0101Adv33_Ema016| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛和雪莉<br>离开了淋浴房。|#0101Adv33_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

